            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gauge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1 fan repeat x 4 rows = 11 x 8 cm after blocking."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern notes"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fan: 7 tr into same ch-sp. Row A (right side): ch 3, dc, * ch 3, skip 4, fan in next ch-sp, ch 3, skip 4, dc; rep. Row B (wrong side): ch 6 (counts as tr, ch 3), * dc in top of fan, ch 3, tr in dc; rep. Repeat rows A and B."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 46 (3 fan repeats, approx. 33 cm wide before blocking). Row 1 (right side): dc in 4th ch, * ch 3, skip 4, 7 tr in next ch, ch 3, skip 4, dc; rep to end. Turn. (3 fans)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 2 (wrong side): ch 6, * dc in top of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fan-repeat-l4"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "fan"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (4th tr), ch 3, tr in next dc; rep, end tr in top of t-ch. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 3 (right side): ch 3, dc in first tr, * ch 3, fan in dc, ch 3, dc in tr; rep, end dc in t-ch. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat rows 2 and 3 until work measures 185 cm (approx. 46 row-pairs) or yarn is nearly used. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Weave in ends. Wet the shawl and pin to full "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "wingspan-l4"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "wingspan"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and depth on a blocking mat. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "blocking-l4"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Blocking"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " opens the fans to their full spread. Leave flat until dry."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
